{"asset_key":"ep8/quest_story_18205220","episode":"ep8","category":"quest_story","story_id":"18205220","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1820522001:0":{"text":"지, 진짜 이상한 사람이네요! 말이 조금만 안 통해도 검부터 휘두르고!","source_cn":"你……你真是个怪人！一言不合就挥剑！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE72705C89F071528","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1820522002:0":{"text":"이상한 건 너다. 네가 바든이라는 건 인정하지 않으면서, 내 모든 기술을 어떻게 파훼하는지 똑똑히 기억하고 있군.","source_cn":"更奇怪的人是你。不肯承认你就是巴登，却牢牢记得如何破解...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD334AA5BFCF3C3B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1820522003:0":{"text":"네가 기억을 잃었어도, 네 몸과 검은 여전히 모든 걸 기억하고 있어.","source_cn":"即使你失忆了，你的身体和你的剑，却依然记得这一切。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F6D667E40B3E5B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1820522004:0":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1820522005:0":{"text":"네가 뮤리엘 할멈을 지키려는 건, 할멈이 네 목숨을 구해 준 은인이기 때문이지?","source_cn":"你想保护穆婆婆，是因为她对你有救命之恩，对吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79EB2C3E614A2F85","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","docu